Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.50,0:09:09.50,Title,0,0,0,0,,《007系列之杀人执照》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.42,0:00:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标航向改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a midcourse deviation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.13,0:00:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标航向036 126里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target heading 036, 126 miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.38,0:00:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,方位062 哈瓦那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bearing 062, Havana, VOR.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.47,0:01:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,降落在魁基\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's landing at Cray Cay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.14,0:01:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,联络缉毒局探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Advise Key West Drug Enforcement.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.85,0:01:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了 长官 空中监视器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger, sir. AWACS to Key West.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫缉毒局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Key West Drug Enforcement, please come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.61,0:01:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,若动作快点 就能逮捕那杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they hurry, they just might be able to grab the bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.20,0:01:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定 你把戒指带来了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you're sure you've got the ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.25,0:01:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松 菲力克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, Felix.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.67,0:01:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你朋友？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friends of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.17,0:01:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我缉毒局的搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}My partners at the DEA.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.52,0:01:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.36,0:01:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑契斯在巴哈马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sanchez is in the Bahamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.28,0:01:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们获得总部批准了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you cleared it with Nassau?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.65,0:01:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,批准了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got the green light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.82,0:01:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧！菲力克！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go! Hey, Felix, Felix!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.99,0:02:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否忘了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't you forgotten something?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.53,0:02:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 向德拉解释好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, James, explain to Della, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.54,0:02:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,门都没有 我跟你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way. I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.58,0:02:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 纯粹观察而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but strictly as an observer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.12,0:02:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 鲨鱼 - 为何是我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry, Sharkey. - Hey, why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.42,0:02:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不能这样对我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you guys, you can't do this to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.88,0:02:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要怎么告诉德拉？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What will I tell Della?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.53,0:02:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他向你承诺了什么？他的心？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did he promise you? His heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.95,0:02:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他的心给她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give her his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.41,0:02:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.58,0:02:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 法兰斯 他并非有意造成任何伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Franz. I didn't mean any harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.75,0:02:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系的 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.75,0:02:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们全都会犯错\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all make mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.59,0:03:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的任性愈来愈有创意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your escapades are getting more creative.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.01,0:03:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也别说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.24,0:03:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还是没到\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.66,0:03:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能再绕一圈吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you go around the block again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.45,0:03:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些客人怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the guests?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.54,0:03:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你 这是个错误！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you this was a mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.96,0:03:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 以防万一\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.90,0:04:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.33,0:04:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要活捉桑契斯！留在这儿 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want Sanchez alive! Stay here, James.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.27,0:04:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有桑契斯 - 可恶！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No Sanchez. - Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.90,0:04:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.03,0:05:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,观察员！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, observer!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.07,0:05:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想送命吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're trying to get yourself killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.03,0:05:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我若不能把你带回去参加婚礼 那我才死定了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I don't get you back for the wedding, I'm a dead man for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.21,0:05:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你需要协助吗？- 不 别碰我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You need help? - No. Take your hands off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.76,0:05:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.09,0:05:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑契斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sanchez!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.26,0:05:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.24,0:06:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧！走吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.59,0:06:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他20分钟就能到古巴领空了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be in Cuban airspace in 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.17,0:06:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还没逃掉呢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hasn't got away yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.01,0:06:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.01,0:06:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去钓鱼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go fishing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.17,0:07:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,向前 向前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forward. Forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.51,0:07:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢一点 稳住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy. Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.01,0:07:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back up. Back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.10,0:07:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,往前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forward now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.15,0:07:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,停住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.20,0:07:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他吊上来！让他头朝下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring him in. Take the load.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.67,0:07:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 请回家吧！我十分抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please go home. I'm very…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.17,0:07:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}WOMAN: There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.55,0:07:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 詹姆斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, James!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.12,0:08:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.68,0:08:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 詹姆斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come along. James!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.72,0:08:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的帽子 - 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your hat. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.07,0:11:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the double!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.94,0:11:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,离门远点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away from the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.70,0:11:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑契斯面对139桩控告\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're facing 139 felony counts, Sanchez.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.70,0:11:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,加起来共936年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, that's 936 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.42,0:11:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使是你出了名的百万贿赂 这次也帮不了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even one of your famous million-dollar bribes can't get you out of this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.88,0:11:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.17,0:11:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.80,0:12:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,二百万美金\N{\fnArial\fs30}$2 million, U.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.47,0:12:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,给任何能让我自由的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A standing offer for anyone who springs me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.35,0:12:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}God damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.76,0:12:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为是在落后国家？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you're in some banana republic?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.48,0:12:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些杂碎钱 在这时候没有用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that scumbag money won't do you a bit of good here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.56,0:12:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.94,0:12:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我认为 我快回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think I'm gonna be home soon, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.57,0:12:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why you…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.15,0:12:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制一下你自己！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a hold of yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.61,0:12:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在广达可有间 单人囚室等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a nice private cell waiting for your ass at Quantico,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.99,0:12:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证你一定会住进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm going to personally see you get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.62,0:12:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我十分抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm terribly sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.38,0:12:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是种传统 新娘总是吻男傧相\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a custom. You see, the bride always gets to kiss her best man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.80,0:12:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为是男傧相吻新娘才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it was the other way around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.14,0:12:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 你不介意吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, James, would you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.39,0:12:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲力克还在书房 我们必须切这个蛋糕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Felix is still in the study, and we've got to cut this cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.85,0:12:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会为手上拿刀的女人 做任何事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do anything for a woman with a knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.02,0:12:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 你们能帮我一下吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Yes, could you help me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.70,0:13:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 - 不 不 我们结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - No, no. Come in. We're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.87,0:13:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,潘 见过詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pam, meet James.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.12,0:13:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 菲力克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, Felix.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.54,0:13:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,纯粹公事 我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strictly business, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.33,0:13:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那东西关掉 菲力克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Switch that thing off, Felix.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.83,0:13:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你有一屋子的客人在等\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you have a house full of guests waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.75,0:13:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我把这个弄完 请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let me save this. Take a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.05,0:13:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那部门要昨天完整的报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}The department wants a full report, yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.63,0:13:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今天是运气好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We really hit it lucky today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.47,0:13:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑契斯多年没有离开他的老巢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sanchez hasn't been out of his home base for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.05,0:13:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能引渡吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, couldn't you extradite him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.14,0:13:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,门都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.22,0:13:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他杀人 威胁 收买\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's killed, intimidated or bribed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.89,0:13:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,由这里到智利半数政府官员\N{\fnArial\fs30}half the government officials from here to Chile.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.48,0:13:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那只有一种法律 桑契斯之法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one law down there, Sanchez's law.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.73,0:13:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是追随就是死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lead or silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.49,0:13:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾德！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.65,0:13:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲尔 恭喜你 老友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Double congratulations, old buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.24,0:13:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你慢慢渡蜜月 一切都会很好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take your time on the honeymoon. Everything's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.87,0:13:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定是邦德了 大老远跑来助一臂之力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be Bond, the guy who came along for the ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.54,0:13:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾德基佛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed Killifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.62,0:14:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今天下午送桑契斯去广达可\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're taking Sanchez to Quantico this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.84,0:14:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下来和我们喝一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, stay and have a drink with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.59,0:14:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我得赶回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't. Got to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.71,0:14:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是顺道来吻新娘的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just came by to kiss the bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.26,0:14:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲力克 切蛋糕的时间到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Felix, it's time to cut the cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.76,0:14:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,把德拉的照片给我 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hand me the picture of Della. Quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.77,0:14:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一定准备好要杀我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She must be ready to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.44,0:14:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲手绑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tied them myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.74,0:14:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这些是什么？- 假钓鱼饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are these? - Lures!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.61,0:14:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些能使你们忙几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}These'll keep you busy for the next few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.61,0:14:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的蜜月上 别想去钓鱼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going fishing on my honeymoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.95,0:14:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面还关了什么人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many others are being held in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.00,0:14:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要带他去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you taking him, Mr. Killifer?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.62,0:14:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何到巴哈马去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, why did you go to the Bahamas?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.79,0:14:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑契斯先生 请看这边 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Sanchez, will you look this way for a picture, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.25,0:14:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 把他弄进里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, get him inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.34,0:14:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的是哥伦比亚人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you really a Colombian?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.93,0:14:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否受到公平的待遇？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you been fairly treated?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.47,0:14:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,请再拍一张照片！\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more picture, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.14,0:14:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和南美洲任何实验室有关吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you connected with any laboratories in South America?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.47,0:14:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何要去巴哈马？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you go to the Bahamas?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.73,0:14:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不准再发问了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.06,0:15:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会要辩护吗？桑契斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you expect to be vindicated, Mr. Sanchez?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.48,0:15:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.61,0:15:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}ED: Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.15,0:15:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we're moving out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.17,0:15:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 借几分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you excuse me, Liala? Just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.67,0:15:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有个惊喜给你 - 真的？噢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have a surprise for you. - Oh, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.30,0:15:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这边来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I do. It's right over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.43,0:15:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.31,0:15:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,「詹姆斯！永远爱你 德拉与菲力克赠」\N{\fnArial\fs30}James. Love always, Della and Felix.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.32,0:15:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.69,0:15:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.61,0:16:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.51,0:16:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你抓住他了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.80,0:16:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.93,0:17:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不见他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.10,0:17:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有多深？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How deep is it there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.35,0:17:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有多少人在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many were inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.85,0:17:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, James!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.72,0:17:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有件东西要给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted you to have something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.56,0:17:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道那传统\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the tradition?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.02,0:17:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个接到这个的 表示要\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next one who catches this is the next one who…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.77,0:17:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.65,0:17:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 德拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Thanks, Della.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.78,0:17:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time I left.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.99,0:17:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, James.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.00,0:18:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说错什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I say something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.46,0:18:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他曾结过婚 但是很久之前的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was married once, but it was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.72,0:18:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲力克 你的腰断掉了 对我没好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Felix, you're no good to me with a wrecked back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.90,0:18:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她走 你们要的是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her go. I'm the one you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.29,0:18:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 准备走了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Ready to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.00,0:18:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,潜水艇电池充电过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got the batteries recharged on the sub.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.04,0:18:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,以极速十二里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll take you to the 12-mile limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.38,0:18:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,开往古巴 你可以在那吃早餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fast boat to Cuba, you'll be there for breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.42,0:18:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松 我们等达瑞欧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax. We'll wait for Dario.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.17,0:18:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.01,0:19:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都在找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got everybody looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.26,0:19:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,基佛呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Killifer?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.80,0:19:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那条子纯粹是个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having a cop here is nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.01,0:19:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要送他「上路」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to deep-six him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.10,0:19:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和那家伙谈好了 我不能食言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made a deal with this guy, and I'm going to keep my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.40,0:19:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢他 他可以指证我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like it. He can finger me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.36,0:19:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这公司上投下一笔财富\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spent a fortune on this cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.61,0:19:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好了解一些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something you'd better understand, amigo,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.91,0:19:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,忠诚比金钱对我来的重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}loyalty is more important to me than money.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.87,0:19:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在去叫那条子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, get the cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.37,0:19:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,基佛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.05,0:19:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是两百万 全都是二十元面额\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's $2 million, all in twenties.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.72,0:19:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,很重 但很难追查\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very heavy, but difficult to trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.09,0:19:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.22,0:19:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天预备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be ready for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.64,0:19:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会派人来接你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have someone to pick you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.18,0:19:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欧培呢？- 在船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Lupe? - On the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.73,0:19:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她留在那直到 我派人来接她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep her there until I send for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.27,0:19:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,别对我女友乱来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, no fooling around with my girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.61,0:20:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开玩笑？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.65,0:20:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你那样对待那家伙之后？\N{\fnArial\fs30}After what you did to that guy on the islands?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.86,0:20:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢我的小情人 对不对？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You liked my little valentine, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.60,0:20:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太太在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.44,0:20:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我们给了她很好的蜜月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. We gave her a nice honeymoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.53,0:20:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你明白 这非私人恩怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to know this is nothing personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.75,0:20:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,纯粹…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's purely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.91,0:20:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,公事\N{\fnArial\fs30}business.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.86,0:21:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,基佛！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killifer!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.03,0:21:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 老友 但二百万是大数目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, old buddy, but two mil is a hell of a chunk of dough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.74,0:21:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑契斯 杀了我无济于事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing me won't stop anything, Sanchez!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.25,0:21:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,有比死更糟的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are worse things than dying, hombre.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.38,0:21:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱见了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you in hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.05,0:21:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.22,0:21:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是你余生的第一天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today's the first day of the rest of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.39,0:21:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.68,0:22:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}WOMAN: Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.01,0:22:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早 - 早\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good morning. - Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.43,0:22:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.98,0:22:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦 你的护照\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your passport, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.94,0:22:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.23,0:22:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个大毒枭逃脱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some big drug dealer just escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.95,0:22:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸烟区还是禁烟区？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, will that be smoking or non-smoking, Mr…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.28,0:22:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的机票！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your ticket!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.27,0:23:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲立克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Felix?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.87,0:23:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Della!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.72,0:24:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Della?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.89,0:24:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲立克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Felix.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.14,0:24:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be all right. Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.65,0:24:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 你到哪去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}MAN: Hey, Leiter. Where you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.57,0:24:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是邦德 快叫救护车来此\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Bond. Get an ambulance here, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.83,0:25:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 鲨鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Sharkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.83,0:25:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你暂时别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stick around.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.08,0:25:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有问题问你 行吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might have some more questions for you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.88,0:25:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他情况如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.30,0:25:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,左膝盖以下没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His left leg's gone below the knee.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.42,0:25:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也许能挽救他的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}They might be able to save his arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.42,0:25:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是链锯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can bet it was a chain saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.30,0:25:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥伦比亚人用来对付告密者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colombians love to use them on informers.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.76,0:25:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在这比在奥勒冈州 卖得还多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, they sell more here than in the state of Oregon.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.02,0:25:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望我能更乐观\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could be more hopeful,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.85,0:25:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但得等着瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we'll have to wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.52,0:25:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,链锯个屁！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chain saw, my ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.73,0:25:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认得鲨吻 我看过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know a shark bite when I see one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.70,0:25:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑契斯逃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sanchez has vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.33,0:25:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,取走莱特所有档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got all of Leiter's files.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.95,0:25:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道里面是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}God only knows what's in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.46,0:25:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.92,0:25:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在管辖权之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's out of our jurisdiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.58,0:25:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有很多国家 愿意保护他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, there's plenty of countries that will protect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.25,0:25:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们甚至不能引渡\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't even get an extradition.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.88,0:25:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are other ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.97,0:25:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了吧 中校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let it go, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.97,0:25:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么也不干？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to do nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.09,0:25:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算这么算了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just going to forget all about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.26,0:26:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我才不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not gonna forget about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.39,0:26:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来桑契斯通边界以北的人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like Sanchez's law operates north of the border, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.73,0:26:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去猎鲨吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go shark hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.49,0:26:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是海边最后一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the last place in the Keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.82,0:26:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面得试试迈阿密了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have to try Miami next.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.20,0:26:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.38,0:26:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别露面 我来应付\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay out of sight. I'll handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.76,0:26:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们下班了 这里没人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're closed. Ain't nobody here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.23,0:26:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我大老远从伦敦来找你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I've come all the way from London to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.48,0:26:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,环球出口公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}Universal Exports.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.69,0:26:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,要替动物园装运一条\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been retained by the Regent's Park Zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.44,0:26:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,海洋游水动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}to arrange shipment of a Carcharodon carcharias.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.40,0:26:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.53,0:26:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,大白鲨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great white shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.57,0:27:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 菲尔 让他进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right, Bill. Let him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.53,0:27:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不幸 几年前 所有的鲨鱼全卖光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, we sold all our sharks years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.04,0:27:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在纯粹做研究了\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you can see, we do purely research now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.70,0:27:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个养活第三世界的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a project to feed the third world.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.75,0:27:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,把马林鱼培养成 我们特殊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We feed maggots to our special breed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.58,0:27:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,基因鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}of genetically engineered fish,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.79,0:27:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,能繁殖更多公鱼 快速增重\N{\fnArial\fs30}use hormones to make them all male, gain weight faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.14,0:27:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你昔日猎鲨用的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}From your shark-hunting days?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.02,0:27:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上要卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Actually, it's for sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.43,0:27:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很忙 也许改天再聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm kind of busy. Maybe some other time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.90,0:27:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 下次见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. I look forward to seeing you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.20,0:27:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, Mr…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.16,0:27:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.27,0:28:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,克罗斯先生叫你预备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Krest said to be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.27,0:28:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,三小时后会派潜艇来接你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll send the sub back in three hours to pick you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.82,0:28:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,等不下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.45,0:28:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让我起鸡皮疙瘩\N{\fnArial\fs30}This dump gives me the creeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.38,0:28:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}James.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.09,0:30:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那别动！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it, right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.81,0:30:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不介意我把手拿出来吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mind if I get my hands out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.39,0:30:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Do it slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.64,0:31:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.18,0:31:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,到活门去 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over by the trapdoor, old buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.90,0:31:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是把菲力克放在那的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this where you put your old buddy Felix?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.82,0:31:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.66,0:31:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那笔帐是算桑契斯和 克罗斯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chalk that one up to Sanchez and Krest.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.80,0:32:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.39,0:32:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮箱里有两百万美金\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's $2 million in that suitcase.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.19,0:32:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你平分\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll split it with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.70,0:32:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你挣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You earned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.87,0:32:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你留着吧 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep it, old buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.76,0:32:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,多浪费\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, what a terrible waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.93,0:33:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.81,0:33:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲨鱼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sharkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.23,0:33:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,有新浪潮的消息吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any news on the Wavekrest?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.57,0:33:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是艘大型的海事研究船 船东家是米尔顿克罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. She's a big marine research vessel owned by a Milton Krest.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.45,0:33:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,在沙尔班收集特殊贝壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're collecting specimens off the Cay Sal Bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.95,0:33:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,到那儿需要多久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long will it take us to get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.08,0:33:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,约六小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe about six hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.16,0:33:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿几样东西 一小时内准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a few things to pick up. Be ready in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.04,0:33:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.84,0:33:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,中校 有时间吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Commander, you got a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.93,0:33:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚本地警局接获 关于那仓库的密报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Local cops got a tip about a warehouse last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.93,0:33:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到五百公斤哥伦比亚纯可卡因 两具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turned up 500 keys of Colombian pure, a couple of stiffs,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.06,0:33:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,及一小块 基佛的肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a little bitty piece of what used to be Killifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.31,0:33:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 至少有人在办这案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. At least someone's on the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.27,0:33:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也许是莱特好友 但我只能做这么多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may be a pal of Leiter's, but I can only cover up so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.98,0:33:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,检察官吼着 问是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The D.A. Is screaming to know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.49,0:33:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这里也有法律\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we got laws in this country, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.41,0:34:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,有法律对抗对付莱特的人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have a law against what they did to Leiter?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.66,0:34:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你昏了头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you're in over your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.42,0:34:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这结束了 中校\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where it ends, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.50,0:34:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你昨晚就该到伊斯兰堡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were supposed to be in Istanbul last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.33,0:34:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱特不幸的遭遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid this unfortunate Leiter business.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.34,0:34:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒙蔽了你的判断\N{\fnArial\fs30}has clouded your judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.80,0:34:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有工作要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a job to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.13,0:34:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我期望你今天下午上飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I expect you on a plane this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.55,0:35:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的事还没办完\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't finished here, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.97,0:35:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,留给美国人做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave it to the Americans.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.72,0:35:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的烂摊子 让他们自己收\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's their mess. Let them clear it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.56,0:35:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会有什么作为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, they're not going to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.02,0:35:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我欠莱特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I owe it to Leiter.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.23,0:35:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他冒生命危险救过我很多次\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's put his life on the line for me many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.11,0:35:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,省省讲感情那套垃圾！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spare me this sentimental rubbish.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.94,0:35:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他清楚要冒什么险\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knew the risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.65,0:35:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有他太太？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.07,0:35:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这件报私仇的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This private vendetta of yours could easily compromise.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.37,0:35:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,能轻易使女王陛下政府受窘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her Majesty's government.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.28,0:35:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有任务！我希望你能\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have an assignment, and I expect you to carry it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.66,0:35:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,客观和专业的完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}objectively and professionally.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.87,0:35:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我辞职\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you have my resignation, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.34,0:35:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,007 我们不是乡村俱乐部\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not a country club, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.88,0:35:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻生效！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Effective immediately,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.84,0:35:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀人执照注销\N{\fnArial\fs30}your license to kill is revoked,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.26,0:35:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要求你交回武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I require you to hand over your weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.43,0:35:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就交\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.40,0:35:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要提醒你 你依然受官方秘密协定的约束\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need hardly remind you that you're still bound by the Official Secrets Act.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.65,0:36:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then I guess it's.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.20,0:36:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,向武器再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}a farewell to arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.67,0:36:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪！太多人了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't! Too many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.38,0:36:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,主保佑你 中校\N{\fnArial\fs30}God help you, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.15,0:36:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,C区有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something in sector C.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.13,0:37:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐 你替大家惹不少麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You caused us all a lot of trouble, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.50,0:37:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这恶棍 去睡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're borracho. Go to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.92,0:37:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑契斯听说你逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Sanchez heard you ran away,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.80,0:37:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他气疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he went nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.85,0:37:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,与你无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.14,0:37:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你这笨女人让桑契斯被捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my business when your stupid little tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.43,0:37:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,就和我有关了\N{\fnArial\fs30}get Sanchez arrested,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.52,0:37:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得用我的组织 不顾一切去救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I gotta put my organization at risk to get him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.15,0:37:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,缉毒局刚才突击了迈亚密湾\N{\fnArial\fs30}The DEA just raided Key West.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.65,0:37:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我损失不少毒品\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cost me a lot of dough.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.99,0:37:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会给你钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll give you the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.83,0:37:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是他的作风\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't work that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.83,0:37:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better watch yourself, girlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.08,0:37:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识他很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've known him a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.17,0:37:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你这样的女孩 来来去去不知多少个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen a lot of girls like you come and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.71,0:37:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喝醉了 出去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're drunk. Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.22,0:37:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再从我窗户偷看\N{\fnArial\fs30}And stop peeking through my windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.55,0:37:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那么臭美干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come on, come on, what are you so stuck-up for?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.97,0:37:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他安排让你赢得选美\N{\fnArial\fs30}He fixed that phony beauty contest you won.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.22,0:37:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,克罗斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Mr. Krest?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.98,0:37:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.23,0:37:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑得诺在显像器上 发现大物体\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Sentinel's picking up something large on the monitor, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.94,0:38:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你最好去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you'd better take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.44,0:38:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直无法相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.58,0:38:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.38,0:38:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是只鲨鱼 收回探测器\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a manta ray. Get the probe back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.00,0:38:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在开始装货\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll start loading now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.38,0:38:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.16,0:40:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说你没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.86,0:40:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好照顾他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.22,0:41:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要出声 就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make a sound and you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.26,0:41:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.72,0:41:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.73,0:41:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,克罗斯把他的舱给我住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Krest gave me his cabin.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.60,0:41:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他住隔壁 桑契斯在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's next door. Where's Sanchez?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.40,0:41:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不在船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not onboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.07,0:41:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.73,0:41:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是他女友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're his girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.24,0:41:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他什么都不告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't tell me anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.91,0:41:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开 我需要跟你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open it. I need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.83,0:41:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,去应门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answer it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.08,0:41:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.75,0:41:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想干嘛？- 有人溜上船了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you want? - Somebody slipped aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.84,0:41:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见任何人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see anybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.42,0:41:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我在睡觉 走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I was sleeping. Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.51,0:41:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,克罗斯先生 他们回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Krest. They're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.43,0:42:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,拴上你的门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bolt your door.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.60,0:42:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁打你？桑契斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who whipped you? Sanchez?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.15,0:42:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.23,0:42:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做错事 让他生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did something wrong, made him angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.08,0:42:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳 干得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice work, Clive.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.29,0:42:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 猜猜看怎么回事？他叫鲨鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Mr. Krest. Guess what? His name was Sharkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.29,0:42:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,把船处理掉 我们有工作要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get rid of the boat. We've got work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.26,0:42:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好找个新爱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd better find yourself a new lover.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.59,0:42:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们男人 就不知道其他方法了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you men know any other way?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.89,0:42:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑契斯的方法 你好像很喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Sanchez's way. You seem to like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.93,0:42:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂个鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.89,0:42:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,请离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.02,0:42:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,若他们找到你 我俩都会没命！\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they find you here, we'll both be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.36,0:42:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.61,0:42:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她已经没用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got everything useful out of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.74,0:43:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样了 开出去沉了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. Take her out and sink her.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.86,0:43:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 克劳 下去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Clive. Cast off!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.29,0:43:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲨鱼向你致意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Compliments of Sharkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.33,0:43:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人落水了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man overboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.35,0:43:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他！别让他跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him! Don't let him get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.52,0:43:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.60,0:43:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,回你的舱里待着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back in your cabin and stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.81,0:43:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,克罗斯先生 那家伙一定淹死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy must have drowned, Mr. Krest.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.52,0:43:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么有把握 找到他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be so sure. Find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.49,0:43:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.99,0:43:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开桑得诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Launch Sentinel!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.20,0:43:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.05,0:44:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备听我的命令潜水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by to dive when I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.11,0:44:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,一号、二号 潜水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Numbers one and two, dive!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.50,0:44:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到有反光\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see something reflecting over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.64,0:44:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,太多水花无法确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's too much turbulence to be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.90,0:45:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,新浪潮！新浪潮！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wavekrest! Wavekrest!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.12,0:45:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,克罗斯先生 装好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loading completed, Mr. Krest.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.58,0:45:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,收回桑得诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring Sentinel back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.91,0:45:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.96,0:45:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,克罗斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Krest!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.67,0:46:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,带桑得诺上来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring Sentinel up!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.93,0:46:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那！在那！抓住他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is! There! Right there! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.30,0:46:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}There!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.14,0:46:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,潜水！该死！潜水！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dive, damn it! Dive!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.35,0:46:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.86,0:49:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里！把他捞上来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}There! Pick him up!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.66,0:49:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有船只回到新浪潮\N{\fnArial\fs30}All boats return to Wavekrest!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.58,0:49:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.47,0:51:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Put her stern-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.20,0:51:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,包维尔在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, do you know someone called Bouvier?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.66,0:51:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.00,0:51:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是令人意外的惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is an unexpected pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.54,0:51:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱特呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Leiter?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.87,0:51:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,医院 加护病房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hospital, intensive care.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.54,0:51:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你不快离开 你也会在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you'll be if you don't get out of here fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.46,0:51:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑契斯有莱特的档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sanchez has Leiter's files.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.34,0:51:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面有你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your name's all over them.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.47,0:51:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼了！我就知道不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I knew something was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.47,0:51:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那两个家伙在酒吧待好久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those two have been at the bar for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.18,0:51:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能在看谁露脸来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably waiting to see who showed up to meet me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.47,0:51:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝杯酒吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like anything to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.14,0:51:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,啤酒加莱姆 一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bud with a lime. Yeah, same.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.94,0:51:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure thing, hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.44,0:51:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了！是达瑞欧 他是个煞星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit! It's Dario. He's bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.11,0:52:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,在被踢出来之前 也是中情局约雇人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}He used to be with the Contras before they kicked him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.74,0:52:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是桑契斯会派的那种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the kind of guy Sanchez would send.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.87,0:52:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有带家伙吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You carrying?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.29,0:52:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,一开火 你就趴下待在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they start shooting, you just hit the deck and stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.93,0:52:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在哪见过？\N{\fnArial\fs30}La senorita Bouvier.Don't I know you from somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.73,0:52:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Oh, yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.44,0:52:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前也为我朋友开飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}You used to fly charter planes for some friends of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.90,0:52:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有样工作给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a job for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.99,0:52:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到外面私下谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we go outside, and we talk in private.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.74,0:52:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰她！她和我一起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your hands off her. She's with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.53,0:52:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's asking you, gringo.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.45,0:52:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟我一起 把你的手放在桌上\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's with me. Keep your hands on the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.71,0:52:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.30,0:53:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,二瓶 一共三块半\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two beers. That'll be $3.50.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.34,0:53:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你朋友要喝什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do your friends want something?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.43,0:53:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来付！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.35,0:53:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说喝够了 改天吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's had enough. Run a tab.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.60,0:53:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.10,0:53:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么来的？- 搭船 ？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How did you get here? - By boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.56,0:53:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在哪儿？- 墙后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is it? - Back behind this wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.70,0:53:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.49,0:54:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Touche.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.17,0:54:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,去发动吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it started.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.94,0:54:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.56,0:55:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.72,0:55:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张 防弹背心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax. It's a bulletproof vest.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.39,0:55:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}This Kevlar's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.40,0:55:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能活着已经很幸运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're bloody lucky to be alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.81,0:55:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是运气 是经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not luck. It's experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.11,0:55:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,再高几寸就是你的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few inches higher, it'd have been your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.40,0:55:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚救了你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I just saved your life back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.41,0:55:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,若非是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it wasn't for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.66,0:55:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已被钉在墙上\N{\fnArial\fs30}your ass would've been nailed to the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.45,0:55:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved my life?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.74,0:55:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.29,0:55:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你挑了最苦的一行\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a tough business you've picked, Miss Bouvier.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.75,0:55:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,留给专业人士吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave it to the professionals.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.17,0:55:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当过陆军飞行员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, pal, I was an army pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.58,0:55:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,在南美最恶劣的地方飞过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have flown to the toughest hellholes in South America,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.42,0:55:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要你教我如何专业！\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I will not have you lecture me about professionalism.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.02,0:55:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没油了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.60,0:56:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很久没碰到这事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't heard that one in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.27,0:56:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定打中燃料管路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they must have hit the fuel line.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.90,0:56:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm gonna need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.40,0:56:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要彻底毁了桑契斯的作业\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want a complete rundown on Sanchez's operation,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.03,0:56:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,须要私下飞到伊斯马市去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll need a flight to Isthmus City, private.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.28,0:56:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让人知道我走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one must know I've left.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.04,0:56:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去那干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want to go there for?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.66,0:56:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能付你很多钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll pay you very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.62,0:56:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去追桑契斯对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going after Sanchez, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.63,0:56:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意帮我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.25,0:56:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有几个人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many men have you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.34,0:56:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你跟我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.89,0:56:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.01,0:56:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑契斯有整个军队保护他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sanchez has an entire army protecting him down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.22,0:56:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,送我进去 你就走 五万元\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just fly me in and leave. $50, 000.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.94,0:56:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是那么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.44,0:56:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,假飞行计划要买通当地机场\N{\fnArial\fs30}False flight plans, payoffs at Isthmus City Airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.56,0:56:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,低于十万元我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do a job like that for less than 100.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.48,0:56:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,六万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sixty.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.19,0:56:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 九万 - 七万\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ninety. - Seventy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.91,0:56:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 八万 - 七万五\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eighty. - Seventy-five.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.58,0:56:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你付燃料费？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pay the fuel?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.29,0:57:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你负责飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get the plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.58,0:57:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,成交\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.51,0:57:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何不等别人要求你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, why don't you wait until you're asked?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.01,0:57:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何不要求我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, why don't you ask me?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.30,0:57:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一页有五个地方打错\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are five typing errors on the first page alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.89,0:57:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's got into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.22,0:58:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.73,0:58:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国移民局 没有报告显示007\N{\fnArial\fs30}"U.S. Immigration has no reports of 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.52,0:58:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天下午三点离开美国\N{\fnArial\fs30}"leaving the United States as of 1500 hours today."
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.82,0:58:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁授权的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who authorized this?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.53,0:58:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.32,0:58:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你担心詹姆斯 他失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you'd be worried about James. He's gone missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.61,0:58:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你了解他 他会去追杀桑契斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know him better than that. He'll go after Sanchez.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.12,0:58:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got to be stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.91,0:58:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经警告我们该驻地的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've already alerted our man in Isthmus.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.08,0:58:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天下午就要那份东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want that out by this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.42,0:58:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.92,0:58:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦Q部门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Q Branch, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.36,0:58:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是主卧室\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the master bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.49,0:59:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你满意先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope everything is satisfactory, senor.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.41,0:59:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's adequate.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.12,0:59:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要一箱香槟 柏林加拉第牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like a case of champagne, Bollinger R. D.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.08,0:59:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly, senor.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.41,0:59:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 不介意签登记卡吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I could ask you to sign the registration cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.46,0:59:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的执行秘书 会料理\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. My executive secretary, Miss Kennedy, will take care of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.63,0:59:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘迪小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Kennedy…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.34,0:59:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦 这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.65,0:59:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天都要鲜花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fresh flowers every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.02,0:59:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.82,0:59:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的钥匙 住宿愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your key. Enjoy your stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.36,0:59:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘迪小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Ms. Kennedy,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.66,0:59:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何你不能当我的执行秘书？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and why can't you be my executive secretary?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.95,0:59:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,边境以南 是男人的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're south of the border. It's a man's world.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.83,0:59:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 你的工作结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for everything. Your job's finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.54,0:59:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要留下 - 太危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want to stay. - Too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.13,0:59:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,死的人已经够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough people have been killed already.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.51,1:00:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟我谈危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't talk to me about danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.47,1:00:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非桑契斯死 不然我永远不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't be safe until Sanchez is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.97,1:00:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 你会需要我帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, you could use my help.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.85,1:00:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,想做我的执行秘书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you're going to stay and be my executive secretary,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.85,1:00:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好打扮一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd better look the part.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.98,1:00:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好买几件像样的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Buy yourself some decent clothes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.78,1:00:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑契斯用哪间银行？我要存钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}What bank does Sanchez use? I need to make a deposit.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.53,1:00:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,本市最大的 依斯提斯银行\N{\fnArial\fs30}The biggest one in town, Banco de Isthmus.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.41,1:00:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他的银行\N{\fnArial\fs30}He owns it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.22,1:00:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senor Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.06,1:00:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来存点小钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've come to make a small deposit.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.93,1:00:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确信我楼下的人 相当能干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm sure my people downstairs are quite capable of…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.94,1:00:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please sit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.23,1:01:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是世界上 最大的私人投资基金会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We operate the world's largest private investment fund.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.53,1:01:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最大的问题 就是怎么处理这钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our biggest problem is what to do with all the money.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.99,1:01:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天现金结存超过一千万\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a cash surplus of $10 million a day,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.53,1:01:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,经由我们的银行\N{\fnArial\fs30}which we ship, through our bank,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.50,1:01:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,汇进联邦银行\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the U.S. Federal Reserve,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.00,1:01:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,建立起来的信用度\N{\fnArial\fs30}thus establishing credits.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.96,1:01:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,能用在任何合法投资上\N{\fnArial\fs30}which can be used for any legitimate investment.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.88,1:01:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有人帮助老美解决贸易赤字\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, someone has to help the gringos with their trade deficit.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.59,1:01:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,为邦德先生 开存款四百九十万的收据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make out a deposit receipt for $4, 900, 000 for senor Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.85,1:01:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然每个月会有 同金额的存款\N{\fnArial\fs30}And of course there will be additional monthly deposits in the same amount.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.52,1:01:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 本银行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. Be assured, we at Banco de Isthmus.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.73,1:01:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,对这种户口很有经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}are experienced in handling accounts of this nature.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.77,1:01:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me pass, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.78,1:01:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 蒙奇隆哥先生 - 什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Senor Montelongo. - Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.28,1:01:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是甘迪小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Ms. Kennedy,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.74,1:01:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生的执行秘书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bond's executive secretary.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.24,1:01:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会很感激 若你在赌场那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd also appreciate it if you could establish.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.66,1:01:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我安排一下信用额度\N{\fnArial\fs30}a line of credit for me at the casino.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.91,1:01:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,二百万美元如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we say $2 million?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.50,1:01:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.62,1:01:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有很好的抵押品\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have excellent collateral,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.12,1:01:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌场也是我们董事长的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and our chairman also owns the casino.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.54,1:02:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,安排很方便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, a very convenient arrangement.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.46,1:02:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一向如此 小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have always thought so, senorita.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.30,1:02:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 各位先生女士晚安 欢迎收看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Good evening, ladies and gentlemen, and welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.80,1:02:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚很特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a very special night for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.85,1:02:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要各位知道 唯有你们慷慨解囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want you to know that only through your very generous donations.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.18,1:02:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的协会才能经营下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}can the work here at the OMI continue to progress.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.52,1:02:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们学习了这么多 但还只是皮毛而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've learned so much, but we've only just scratched the surface.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.73,1:02:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.82,1:02:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要你到电话旁 打电话捐献\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need you to go to your phones right now and make a pledge.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.45,1:02:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是为我\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.28,1:02:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是为他们 是为了大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not for them. It's for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.03,1:02:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay, reinita?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.49,1:02:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.70,1:02:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,克罗斯由船上打电话给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Krest called me from the boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.04,1:02:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,说他遭抢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a story about somebody ripping him off.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.13,1:02:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时你在 看到什么了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see anything happen when you were there?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.50,1:02:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 法兰斯 我大都待在船舱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Franz. I stayed in my cabin most of the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.84,1:02:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.18,1:02:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter, baby, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.55,1:02:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受不了那玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I can't stand that thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.90,1:03:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要张私人桌子 21点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like a private table. Blacklack.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.02,1:03:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly, senor Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.77,1:03:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you come this way, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.41,1:03:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,25万美金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quarter of a million dollars,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.41,1:03:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要提高赌注 到每一把五千\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'd like to raise the limit to $5, 000 a box.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.12,1:03:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,打给我身后这些义工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put these wonderful volunteers behind me to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.58,1:03:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,达瑞欧明天会带你买东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dario will take you shopping tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.05,1:03:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,花钱开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can spend a lot of money, have fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.09,1:03:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲我一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, give me a little kiss.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.72,1:03:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也要？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want one, too?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.76,1:03:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能涨价\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can raise the price.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.89,1:03:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个月每公斤二万二千元\N{\fnArial\fs30}$22, 000 per kilo this month.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.39,1:03:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.90,1:03:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是杜鲁门拉巨曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, this is Truman-Lodge.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.11,1:03:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,二万二\N{\fnArial\fs30}$22, 000.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.48,1:03:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天的目标是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our goal today is to raise…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.32,1:03:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一单位二万二\N{\fnArial\fs30}$22, 000 from each of our meditation chapters.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.95,1:03:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,二万二\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's $22, 000 each.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.58,1:03:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿起你的电话 协助我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to your phones. Please help us.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.87,1:04:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bless your hearts.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.92,1:04:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,再给我五十万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me have half a million.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.05,1:04:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼哈顿教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to this. Our wonderful Manhattan chapel.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.93,1:04:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚特别捐了五百元\N{\fnArial\fs30}has just made a special $500 pledge.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.22,1:04:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,五百公斤 我知道他们会接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five hundred kilos. I knew they'd go for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.56,1:04:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这令我啼笑皆非\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy cracks me up.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.64,1:04:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑契斯先生在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is senor Sanchez there?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.35,1:04:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, he's right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.77,1:04:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？有个呆子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? I got a British sucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.73,1:04:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚输了25万\N{\fnArial\fs30}who dropped a quarter of a million,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.36,1:04:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要玩没有最高下注额\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he wants to play no-limit.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.24,1:04:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪一桌？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.36,1:04:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,二号桌 玩的方法真像笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Table two. Plays like a real jerk-off.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.37,1:04:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天搭私人飞机来的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the guy that flew in in the private plane today,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.75,1:04:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,在银行里开了户头\N{\fnArial\fs30}opened that account at the bank.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.12,1:04:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,五百万美元现金\N{\fnArial\fs30}$5 million in cash.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.38,1:04:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him play.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.97,1:04:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌注加倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Double down.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.39,1:05:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,分成两门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Split.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.75,1:05:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,听听这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to this.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.88,1:05:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,芝加哥教堂 刚刚收到一笔一千元捐款\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our Chicago chapel has just received a $1, 000 double pledge.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.88,1:05:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们全都接受新价钱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all accepted the new price.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.34,1:05:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 桑契斯先生？- 他在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Senor Sanchez. - Yes, he's right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.39,1:05:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 芝加哥 保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bless your hearts.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.60,1:05:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这英国人赢了25万\N{\fnArial\fs30}The British guy is a quarter-million ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.35,1:05:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要关闭赌桌吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall I close the table?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.82,1:05:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.28,1:05:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫露比进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell Lupe to come in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.53,1:05:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.37,1:06:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今晚运气很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have good luck tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.96,1:06:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些钱要分我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna share any of that money?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.14,1:06:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我叫杯中甜度的 伏特加马丁尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Kennedy, would you get me a medium-dry vodka martini?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.89,1:06:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么我 - 用摇的 不要用搅拌的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, why don't you ask… - Shaken, not stirred.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.43,1:06:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,切牌？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.20,1:06:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有职业水准\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're very professional.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.57,1:06:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前在这工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Used to work here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.62,1:06:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会赢还是会输？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I going to win or lose?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.28,1:06:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,输 但不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lose, but not much.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.42,1:06:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,伏特加马丁尼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vodka martini, que?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.75,1:06:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,用摇的 不用搅拌的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shaken, not stirred.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.34,1:06:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你手气变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like your luck has changed.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.30,1:06:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他派你来的原因吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that why he sent you?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.59,1:07:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,摸清楚你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to find out more about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.01,1:07:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我今晚最好到此为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps I'd better quit for the night.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.31,1:07:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该直接出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should walk straight out of here,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.94,1:07:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,到机场永远别再回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}go to the airport and never come back.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.57,1:07:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑契斯在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Sanchez?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.82,1:07:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,楼上办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Upstairs in his office.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.91,1:07:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,待了一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been there all day.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.08,1:07:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划明晚东方人的派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's planning a big party for some Orientals tomorrow night.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.79,1:07:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么跟他提 新浪潮的事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what did you tell him about the Wavekrest?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.46,1:07:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没说 现在走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. Now go.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.59,1:07:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我去见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.96,1:07:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯啦？我们会因此丧命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You loco? You'll get us both killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.04,1:08:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生这边请\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.17,1:08:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,向我们捐款 五毛钱也行\N{\fnArial\fs30}PROFESSOR JOE: Send us a dollar. Send us 50 cents.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.71,1:08:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,捐你能捐的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send whatever you can send.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.71,1:08:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有非常特别的奖品\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got a very special offer for you guys out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.17,1:08:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚带这你的啤酒 爆米花\N{\fnArial\fs30}with your beer and your popcorn…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.34,1:08:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,请稍待 几乎要结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is almost over.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.39,1:08:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这本特别的书 销售超过25万本\N{\fnArial\fs30}This particular book has sold in excess of a quarter of a million copies.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.60,1:08:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何捐超过一百元的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone who sends in a $100 pledge or more.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.56,1:08:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,将收到由我亲笔签名的书\N{\fnArial\fs30}will receive a personally autographed copy of my book,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.69,1:08:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,椎体电源揭秘\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Secrets of Cone Power Revealed.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.11,1:08:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,景色很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovely view.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.07,1:08:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,定价49点95元 免费赠送给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a $49.95 value, and you get it absolutely free.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.16,1:08:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond, James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.83,1:08:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.45,1:08:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要你的帮助 保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need your help. Bless your hearts.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.34,1:09:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱旅行的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well-traveled man.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.68,1:09:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今晚在赌桌上手气不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did all right at the tables tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.60,1:09:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有感觉手气要变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had the feeling my luck was about to change.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.89,1:09:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,聪明的赌徒 知道手气什么时候变坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's a wise gambler who knows when his luck has run out.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.11,1:09:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何带这个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why this?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.32,1:09:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我这一行 要随时准备迎接变数\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my business, you prepare for the unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.90,1:09:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是哪一行的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what business is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.95,1:09:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮助人解决「麻烦」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I help people with problems.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.87,1:09:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,解决麻烦的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Problem solver?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.87,1:09:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,比较像是消灭麻烦的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}More of a problem eliminator.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.97,1:09:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来办事的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you're here on business?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.34,1:09:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 暂时失业\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Temporarily unemployed.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.77,1:09:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许能在此找到工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I might find work here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.93,1:09:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里很难取得工作许可证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's very difficult to obtain a work permit in Isthmus.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.98,1:10:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,要展现别人没有的特殊技能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, one has to show a special talent that people here don't have.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.95,1:10:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该不太困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that shouldn't be too difficult.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.16,1:10:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 你胆子很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senor Bond, you got big cojones.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.12,1:10:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到我地盘来 没背景 就带枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come here to my place, without references, carrying a piece,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.84,1:10:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这花大把钞票\N{\fnArial\fs30}throwing around a lot of money.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.92,1:10:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要知道一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you should know something…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.96,1:10:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人看见你进来 就不需要有人看见你出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody saw you come in, so nobody has to see you go out.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.31,1:10:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑契斯先生 我对你这种地位的人相当有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senor Sanchez, I could be very useful to a man in your position.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.06,1:10:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解你对忠实\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I understand you have a reputation.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.81,1:10:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,有非常好的奖励名声\N{\fnArial\fs30}for rewarding loyalty very well.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.69,1:10:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我保管几天 我们会再聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll keep this for a few days. We'll talk again.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.99,1:10:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在伊斯马不需要枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you won't need a gun in Isthmus.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.99,1:10:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a very safe city.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.49,1:10:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时 随时欢迎你到赌场来\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the meantime, I welcome you to the casino at all times.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.01,1:11:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,去摸他的底\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check him out.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.05,1:11:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发现什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what did you find out?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.22,1:11:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他坐在两寸防弹玻璃之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's sitting up there behind two inches of armored glass.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.64,1:11:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要大跑才能做掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd need a cannon to get to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.58,1:11:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叔叔来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senor Bond, you'll be pleased to know your uncle has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.79,1:11:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我请他到你套房去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put him in your suite.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.50,1:11:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 晚安 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Good night, senor.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.22,1:11:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叔叔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your uncle?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.93,1:11:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好个家庭聚会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's make this a proper family reunion.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.22,1:11:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.91,1:12:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.68,1:12:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是的 007！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, 007.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.89,1:12:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Q！你在这干嘛？我可能杀了你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Q! What the hell are you doing here? I might have killed you!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.35,1:12:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在休假\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm on leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.15,1:12:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以来看看你的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought I'd pop around and see how you're getting on.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.32,1:12:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？- 当然没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You all right? - Yes, of course I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.40,1:12:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么找到我？- 当然是钱班霓\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How'd you find me? - Well, Moneypenny, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.45,1:12:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,她担心死你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's worried sick about you!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.41,1:12:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该来这 Q 回家去\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is no place for you, Q. Go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.28,1:12:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,007 别傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be an idiot, 007.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.12,1:12:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你想干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know exactly what you're up to.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.87,1:13:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要我的帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}And quite frankly, you're gonna need my help.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.04,1:13:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,若不是有Q部门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, if it hadn't been for Q Branch,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.17,1:13:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你早就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd have been dead long ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.96,1:13:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,给一个渡假男人用的全套配备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything for a man on holiday.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.84,1:13:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸弹闹钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Explosive alarm clock.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.34,1:13:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,保证用过的人不会醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guaranteed never to wake up anybody who uses it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.09,1:13:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,特制牙膏 特别清理型\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dentonite toothpaste, to be used sparingly.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.22,1:13:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,最新发明的塑胶炸药\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the latest in plastic explosive.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.43,1:13:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用得上一些塑胶炸药\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could do with some plastic.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.65,1:13:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我来收烂摊子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought there might be a mess to clean up.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.61,1:13:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,潘 这是Q 我叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pam, this is Q, my uncle.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.44,1:13:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,叔叔 这是甘迪小姐 我表妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle, this is Miss Kennedy, my cousin.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.32,1:13:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定有亲情关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must be related.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.99,1:13:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸会 007 注意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you do? Now, pay attention, 007.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.00,1:13:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这看来似普通摄影机 对不对？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this looks like an ordinary camera, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.46,1:13:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,用哪种底片？120？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of film does it take, 120?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.13,1:13:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 点二口径的高爆弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, .220, high-velocity.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.38,1:13:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这枪能识别主人 这是手掌识别机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this is a signature gun, and that is an optical palm reader.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.64,1:14:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我把这插进去 一旦输入程式\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I plug this into the bottom like that, once I've programmed it…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.94,1:14:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你能用这把枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, nobody can use the gun but you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.82,1:14:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑吧 孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smile, boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.28,1:14:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,别用那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't use the flash!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.74,1:14:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,别去乱碰你不了解的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop fiddling about with things you don't understand!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.49,1:14:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能很容易就杀死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might easily have killed him.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.91,1:14:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪的玩艺\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's odd.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.04,1:14:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们早点休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, let's all get some rest, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.21,1:14:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天会很辛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got a long, hard day ahead of us tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.21,1:14:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 Q\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, Q.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.72,1:14:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,作个美梦 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet dreams, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.72,1:14:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你不会打呼 Q\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you don't snore, Q.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.36,1:14:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都认识杜鲁门\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all know Truman-Lodge,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.03,1:14:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我安全主管 海上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this is my head of security, Colonel Heller.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.87,1:15:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,历史性的一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is an historic moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.08,1:15:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,东西双方携手\N{\fnArial\fs30}East meets West.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.25,1:15:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界毒枭大结合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drug dealers of the world, unite.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.75,1:15:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,额外的红利 你的工作完成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extra bonus. Your job's done.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.01,1:15:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他飞离此地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take Q and fly out of here now.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.76,1:15:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己设法回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make my own way back.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.09,1:15:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.76,1:15:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最好单独行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I work better alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.80,1:16:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这行有很多现金\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this business, there's a lot of cash,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.97,1:16:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,也有很多人手会伸出来想分杯羹\N{\fnArial\fs30}and with a lot of people with their hands out.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.89,1:16:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,换句话说 贿赂\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a word, bribery.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.52,1:16:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.85,1:16:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说出我想说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took the words right out of my pocket.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.07,1:16:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们付钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you pay.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.82,1:17:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟都按月领规费\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone and his brother is on the payroll.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.53,1:17:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你买通市长 警察首长 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you buy a mayor, a chief of police, a general,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.50,1:17:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Presidents.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.21,1:17:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天你醒来 拥有了整个国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day you wake up, you own the whole goddamn country.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.38,1:17:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,随心所欲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you take what you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.05,1:17:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,银行 赌场 航空公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bank, a gambling casino, airline concession.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.14,1:17:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.72,1:17:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,很简单 要政客收银子比吃子弹容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simple. It's easier for the politicians to take silver than lead.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.89,1:17:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,从智利到阿拉斯加 我们有个隐形帝国\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have an invisible empire from Chile to Alaska.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.23,1:17:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友 我们想做的 是让你参与\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I want to do, amigos, is to make you part of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.99,1:17:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要太平洋也纳入\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want the Pacific to be our little puddle.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.66,1:17:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 你们面前的 是一份地理报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you have before you, gentlemen, is a demographic report,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.16,1:17:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据年纪 社会与经济团体\N{\fnArial\fs30}breaking down each of your territories.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.58,1:17:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,列出你们每个人的地盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}by age and socioeconomic group.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.92,1:18:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以清楚的看出 在那个活络的市场上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, as you can clearly see, there is a huge potential demand,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.47,1:18:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有庞大的潜力需求\N{\fnArial\fs30}given the implementation of aggressive marketing.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.93,1:18:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像在美国\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in the United States,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.93,1:18:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑契斯先生 打算出让独家经营权给你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senor Sanchez is prepared to offer each of you exclusive franchises.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.10,1:18:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个地盘一亿元出让\N{\fnArial\fs30}The price is $100 million per territory.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.61,1:18:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你们已算出来 二千万美金一公顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you'll find that works out to $20 million per metric ton, Mr. Tan.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.47,1:18:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们保证 五年的价格和品质\N{\fnArial\fs30}We guarantee quality and price for five years.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.68,1:18:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑契斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senor Sanchez,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.89,1:18:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我们到这开始 就吃的很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}since arriving, we've eaten well,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.77,1:18:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,听了很多好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}heard many good stories,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.85,1:19:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在我付钱之前 我要先看硬体\N{\fnArial\fs30}but before I pay anything, I want to see some hardware.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.90,1:19:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,关先生 硬体不须你付钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Kwang, you don't pay for hardware.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.86,1:19:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你付的是我个人的保证及保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pay for my personal guarantee and protection.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.82,1:19:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然若你要投资一亿元\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely, if you were to invest $100 million,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.66,1:19:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,会想要某种再保险\N{\fnArial\fs30}you would want some reassurance.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.75,1:19:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有错 有何不可？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you're right. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.88,1:19:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天我带你们 去分装中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow, I'll take you to our main distribution center.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.55,1:19:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.01,1:19:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 谢谢你所做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, Q. Thanks for all you've done.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.97,1:19:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.81,1:19:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个出色的作业人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a hell of a field operative.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.06,1:19:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 我们伦敦见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, go. I'll see you back in London.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.66,1:19:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再谈生意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more business.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.41,1:19:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 尽兴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, enjoy yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.87,1:19:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, there!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.16,1:20:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨！- 你好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi! - How are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.30,1:20:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,关先生似乎是个麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}This Kwang, he seems like trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.01,1:20:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何要带他们去看工厂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why show them the labs?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.64,1:20:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 不会曝光的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. He won't expose the operation.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.25,1:20:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗培兹总统阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Excellency, el Presidente Lopez.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.82,1:21:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我支票的金额有误\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's been a mistake with my check.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.44,1:21:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 只有以往金额的一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at it. It's half the usual amount.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.57,1:21:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我被捕时 你非常安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were very quiet when I was arrested.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.24,1:21:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 你只有活着才是总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, you're only President for life.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.94,1:21:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你小心点 你这杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch the birdie, you bastard.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.67,1:22:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take his arm.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.51,1:22:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,还会有这只掌纹枪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who'd have a signature gun?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.39,1:23:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.27,1:23:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是女王陛下政府的财产\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the property of Her Majesty's government.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.02,1:23:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get it?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.19,1:23:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Piss off.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.27,1:23:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁命令你杀桑契斯的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who ordered you to kill Sanchez?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.73,1:23:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人 他是离职的情报员\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one. He's a rogue agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.57,1:23:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我奉令送他回国\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got orders to take him back, one way or the other.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.15,1:23:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是香港缉毒局 你这杂种！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're Hong Kong Narcotics, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.90,1:23:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑契斯要带我们 到他作业中心去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sanchez is taking us to the heart of his operations.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.20,1:23:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经设计多年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been setting it up for years!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.66,1:23:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能希望你这点特技 没吓到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just hope that little stunt of yours hasn't scared him off.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.42,1:23:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me out of these bloody things.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.46,1:23:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 中校 你是个危险人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Commander. You're a loose cannon on deck.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.88,1:23:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要直接把你送回伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm shipping you straight back to London.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.43,1:23:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 留下他！- 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Leave him! - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.18,1:23:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.96,1:24:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他们活捉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let them take you alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.50,1:24:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.01,1:25:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁？谁派你来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was it? Who sent you?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.35,1:25:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,氰化物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cyanide.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.50,1:26:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, amigo!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.10,1:26:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.26,1:26:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会活下去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll survive.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.81,1:26:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,露比 劳驾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lupe, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.61,1:26:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,新浪潮今晚会到 克罗斯会来这\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Wavekrest is arriving tonight. Krest is coming here.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.61,1:26:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 我一会打给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, I'll call you back.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.14,1:27:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,自由职业杀手组\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freelance hit team.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.18,1:27:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你有何需求？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did they want with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.94,1:27:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个必定 在赌场认出我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them must have recognized me in the casino.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.07,1:27:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们怕我警告你 坏了他们的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were afraid I'd warn you, spoil their plans.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.03,1:27:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you knew them?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.36,1:27:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前为英国政府工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to work for the British government.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.32,1:27:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有这种人的档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}We kept dossiers on such people.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.49,1:27:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国情报员\N{\fnArial\fs30}British agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.12,1:27:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.58,1:27:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有格调\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have class.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.75,1:27:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些人想要杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those men tried to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.51,1:27:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会做这种事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who would do such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.18,1:27:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身边的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone close to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.59,1:27:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶精？糖？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cream? Sugar?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.97,1:27:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.39,1:27:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他们告诉你的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did they tell you this?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.35,1:28:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有内线告诉他们 显然有人通风报信\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were well-briefed, obviously by someone on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.40,1:28:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有提到名字吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did they mention a name?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.77,1:28:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.28,1:28:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们等今晚到的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only that they were expecting to be paid a great deal of cash.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.87,1:28:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,付他们一大笔现金\N{\fnArial\fs30}by someone arriving in Isthmus tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.54,1:28:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在怀疑谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You suspect someone?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.87,1:28:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我组织里的人绝对忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone in my organization is 100% loyal.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.67,1:28:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就没有什么好担心的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you have nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.05,1:28:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得见几个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I have to go meet some people.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.26,1:28:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you rest here?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.34,1:28:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我得回旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I have to go back to my hotel.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.89,1:28:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,别回旅馆 钱省下来 我坚持\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Don't go to the hotel. Save your money. I insist.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.27,1:28:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在这里 接受我的款待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here. Enjoy my hospitality.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.35,1:28:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,露比 带他上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lupe, show him the easy way up, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.75,1:29:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会相信这家伙是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not gonna believe who this guy is.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.30,1:29:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,前英国情报员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Former British agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.47,1:29:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know that?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.09,1:29:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I know things.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.10,1:29:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今晚要和克罗斯在船上见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to meet Krest's boat tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.60,1:29:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要十二个可靠的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll need a dozen reliable men.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.39,1:29:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,克罗斯有问题吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a problem with Krest?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.10,1:29:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候便知 带露比 她当时在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see. And bring Lupe. She was there.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.56,1:29:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,在她面前 他不会说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not gonna lie in front of her.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.74,1:29:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.32,1:29:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受够了桑契斯的款待\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had my fill of Sanchez's hospitality.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.45,1:29:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要你留下来 你自找麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told you to stay. You're asking for big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.87,1:29:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 不需要你介入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, there's no need for you to get involved.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.12,1:29:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我五分钟 然后你就尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give me five minutes, then scream your head off.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.12,1:29:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, please, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.79,1:29:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都是警卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's guards all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.33,1:29:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你逃不掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll never make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.74,1:30:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去买东西 不会去太久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going shopping. I won't be long.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.50,1:30:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,请别走 不是现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't. Not now.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.21,1:30:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑契斯先生交待的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senor Sanchez said.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.52,1:30:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我五年没抽烟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't had one of these in five years.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.31,1:30:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 007会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. 007 always comes back.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.03,1:30:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.24,1:30:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Q 我不是叫你走吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I told you to leave, Q.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.40,1:30:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道你发生何事 我们不能走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We couldn't go without knowing what had happened to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.32,1:30:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,收拾行李\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your bags packed, Q.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.66,1:31:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.66,1:31:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有几件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a couple of things.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.41,1:31:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,关先生和他的队员是英国情报员 他们死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kwang and his team of British agents are dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.66,1:31:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑契斯还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sanchez is alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.75,1:31:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见你在海的办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you in Heller's office.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.38,1:31:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你与他们是一伙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're working with them. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.21,1:31:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要听实话 - 我是在说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want the truth. - I am telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.88,1:31:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑契斯从游击队买四枚飞弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sanchez has arranged to buy four Stinger missiles from the Contras,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.63,1:31:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,若检察官不罢手\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he's threatened to shoot down an American airliner.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.72,1:31:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会打下一架美国民航机\N{\fnArial\fs30}if the DEA doesn't lay off.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.10,1:31:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这和你跟海有何关系？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that got to do with you and Heller?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.89,1:31:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲力克给我一封司法部长 给海的特赦信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Felix gave me a letter at his wedding from the Attorney General.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.31,1:31:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他可以追回那些飞弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}granting Heller immunity if he gets the Stingers back.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.90,1:31:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他接受交易了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he go for the deal?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.61,1:31:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.20,1:31:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没打中桑契斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you missed Sanchez,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.99,1:31:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,海先生惊慌了 他说交易取消\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Heller panicked and he said the deal was off,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.08,1:31:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,若他再看到我 我就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that I was dead if he ever saw me again.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.83,1:31:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不只是你个人的复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more to this than your personal vendetta.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.42,1:31:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一塌糊涂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a mess.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.05,1:32:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑契斯加强三倍守卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sanchez has tripled his security.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.14,1:32:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远无法杀死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll never get another shot at him.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.48,1:32:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不需如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.86,1:32:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,两小时后港务局会合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet me at the harbor master's office in two hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.11,1:32:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,把劳斯莱斯开到旅馆前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Q, bring the Rolls round to the front of the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.66,1:32:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.54,1:32:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senor Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.12,1:32:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒙奇隆哥先生 我们来提款\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senor Montelongo, I'm making a withdrawal.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.85,1:32:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,导航员上来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pilot coming aboard, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.73,1:32:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？带我去舰桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well? Take me to the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.41,1:33:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 我来接手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gracias, Captain. I'll take over now.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.49,1:33:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你？你是港口领航员？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You? You're the harbor pilot?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.20,1:33:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是他的秘书\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm his secretary!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.50,1:33:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All yours, sir… Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.68,1:33:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得进港速度太快？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think you're going in a bit too fast?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.10,1:33:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想掌舵吗？舵交给你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna do the driving? You take the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.99,1:33:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,全速前进！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full speed astern.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.96,1:33:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.87,1:33:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,撞到防波堤！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check the forward component!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.21,1:33:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,港口导航员发疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harbor pilot went crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.75,1:34:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,若我是你 我宁愿开飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd stick to flying if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.41,1:34:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完成了我的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the job done.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.59,1:34:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,法兰斯！真是惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Franz, what a surprise!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.93,1:34:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到你会在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think you'd be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.77,1:34:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 我喜欢出其不意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I like surprises.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.48,1:35:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近好像有不少麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem to be having a lot of problems lately.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.94,1:35:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了个发疯的领航员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we had this crazy harbor pilot.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.03,1:35:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈谈你欠我的钱吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's talk about the money you owe me.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.78,1:35:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we talk inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.38,1:35:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他有保险箱吗？- 不在上面 也许在下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Does he have a safe? - Not up here. Maybe below.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.13,1:35:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,四处看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a look around.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.35,1:35:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,先弄清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I have this right?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.94,1:35:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在飞机后面滑水 跳上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He water-skied behind the plane, jumps on it…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.77,1:35:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. He was…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.40,1:35:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.65,1:35:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把飞行员丢出来 然后飞走\N{\fnArial\fs30}He threw the pilots out and flew away.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.28,1:35:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像只小鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a little bird.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.84,1:36:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,刀子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The knife.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.35,1:36:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩德罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pedro.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.75,1:36:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会编这种故事？你一定看到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would I make up a story like that? You must have seen something.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.26,1:36:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 007在哪？- 他马上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's 007? - He's coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.70,1:37:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我的钱 我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not my money. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.07,1:37:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, amigo. It's mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.25,1:37:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为我笨？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm stupid, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.42,1:37:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想污我的钱 雇人来杀我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You rip me off, then use my own money to pay someone to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.67,1:37:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那么想要？拿去吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want it so bad? Then take it!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.72,1:37:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.47,1:37:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 跟我谈谈 不是我的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Let me talk. It's not my money!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.94,1:37:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! What the…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.52,1:37:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That hurts. Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.78,1:37:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.78,1:38:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑契斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sanchez.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.63,1:38:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你 法兰斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Franz. No!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.15,1:38:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the money, patron?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.94,1:38:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,洗干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}Launder it.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.29,1:38:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们从这走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where you leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.75,1:38:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,搭飞机 迈阿密见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the plane. I'll see you both in Miami.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.01,1:38:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you coming?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.55,1:38:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他们会追杀我 我自己一个人比较安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. They'll be after me. It'll be safer on my own.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.65,1:39:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.99,1:39:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you later.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.17,1:39:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.42,1:39:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德的衣服 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond's clothes. They're clean.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.02,1:39:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉吵醒你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to wake you, hermano.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.53,1:40:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你想知道 你给我的情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you'd like to know the information you gave me paid off.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.41,1:40:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓到设计我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the guy who set me up.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.91,1:40:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one guy?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.29,1:40:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,此话怎讲？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.91,1:40:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just thought that.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.08,1:40:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会笨到一个人来做掉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}no one would be stupid enough to try to take you on on their own.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.10,1:40:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天和我一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I want you to come with me tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.68,1:40:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.52,1:40:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个惊喜 你会喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a surprise. You're gonna like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.33,1:40:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 你回来干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, what are you doing back here?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.71,1:40:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认为你在这是个好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think your being here's a good idea, Lupe.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.96,1:40:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 法兰斯和中国人在吃晚饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. Franz is having dinner with the Chinese.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.21,1:40:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天他带我去哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know where he's taking me tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.84,1:41:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个特别的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's showing them a special place.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.72,1:41:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know where.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.55,1:41:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 别走 我怕 我们会发生什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, don't go. I'm scared. What's gonna happen to us?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.60,1:41:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.89,1:41:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,当一切结束时 我会确定你回到家\N{\fnArial\fs30}When this is all over, I'll make sure you get back home.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.23,1:41:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,家？我花了十五年才离开那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home? It took me 15 years to get away from there.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.15,1:41:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna go back.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.82,1:41:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能一起走吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't we leave together?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.65,1:41:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你在一起比较安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be safe with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.83,1:41:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 露比 我不觉得这样很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Lupe. I don't think that would work out.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.08,1:41:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没试过 怎么知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can we tell unless we try?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.88,1:41:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为这样会很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's gonna work out very well.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.64,1:41:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我来开\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'll answer it.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.35,1:41:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘迪小姐？我在赌场看过你跟詹姆斯在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Kennedy, I saw you at the casino with James.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.77,1:42:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要私下谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to speak in private.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.28,1:42:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 他是自己人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. He's with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.65,1:42:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯有危险 桑契斯不是笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}James is in danger. Sanchez is no fool.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.41,1:42:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在查他 如果他们发现任何可疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's checking up on him. You know, if they find anything suspicious…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.12,1:42:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该已经安全离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, it's all right. He's safely out of the country by now.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.70,1:42:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.00,1:42:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚他跟我在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last night, he stayed with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.63,1:42:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,在桑契斯家？\N{\fnArial\fs30}At Sanchez's house?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.26,1:42:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,法兰斯一小时内要带他出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Si. Franz is taking him on a trip.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.22,1:42:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要帮他\N{\fnArial\fs30}They leave in an hour. You must help him.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.38,1:42:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,若他发生什么事 我不知道该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anything happens to him, I don't know what I'll do.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.10,1:42:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很爱詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I love James so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.06,1:42:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人找你前快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you must go before you're missed.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.39,1:42:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我们会想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, don't worry. We'll think of something.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.40,1:42:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我很爱詹姆斯」 若我帮他我就受天谴\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I love James so much." I'll be damned if I'll help him.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.28,1:42:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,别对他太苛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, don't judge him too harshly, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.57,1:42:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为了达成任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Field operatives must often use every means at their disposal.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.82,1:42:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要不择手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}to achieve their objectives.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.53,1:42:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡说八道！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.92,1:43:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德刚离开别墅 两辆车及一辆吉普\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond's just left in convoy. Two cars and a Jeep,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.59,1:43:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,北上高速公路\N{\fnArial\fs30}turning north onto the main highway.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.51,1:43:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 收到了 - 通话完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I copy that, Q. - Over and out.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.15,1:43:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我的飞机怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing to my plane?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.74,1:43:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,仔细检查 桑契斯先生的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Overhaul. Senor Sanchez order it.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.62,1:43:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须有架飞机 哪里租得到？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must have a plane. Where can I rent one?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.79,1:43:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}No planes.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.30,1:43:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought the Stingers, manito.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.84,1:43:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在起我要它们随时在我身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}From now on, I want them close to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.92,1:44:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地方只是掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}We started this place strictly as a cover,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.21,1:44:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔博士带来很多利润\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Professor Joe manages to turn a tidy profit.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.66,1:44:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎光临 这边请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome. This way, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.03,1:44:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你们都戴上这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to have to ask that each of you put on one of these.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.25,1:45:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了安全起见 确定你会了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for your own safety, so I'm sure you'll understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.17,1:45:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让我们最佳客户 染上毒瘾\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't have our best customers developing a drug habit.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.34,1:45:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.71,1:45:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的产品能在普通汽油中 完全溶解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our product dissolves completely in ordinary gasoline,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.59,1:45:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对测不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}making it absolutely undetectable.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.31,1:46:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,如何还原？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you get it back?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.64,1:46:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为合伙人后 再告诉你秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you want us to tell you all our secrets before we're partners?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.86,1:46:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他们去实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take them to the lab.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.44,1:46:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.08,1:46:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位新人是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's the new guy?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.54,1:46:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,有用的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody I thought could be useful.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.60,1:46:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要效劳吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.89,1:46:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要给乔教授一个惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a special surprise for Professor Joe.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.10,1:46:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 本周不接受访客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. No visitors this week.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.64,1:46:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我大老远来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came all the way from Wichita Falls.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.06,1:46:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 家乡的人一起捐的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - The folks back home took up a collection.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.32,1:46:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,若乔教授不亲自收下 他们会很失望的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd be so disappointed if Professor Joe didn't accept it personally.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.45,1:46:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 可以卸下口罩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may remove your masks now, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.62,1:47:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,成交了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, do we have a deal?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.29,1:47:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 条件是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The terms, gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.17,1:47:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一亿元无记名债卷\N{\fnArial\fs30}were $100 million in negotiable bearer bonds from each of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.67,1:47:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.35,1:47:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔教授 真的是你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor Joe. It's really you!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.27,1:47:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.15,1:47:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,全是一块块石块堆砌成的 重造它以前的光辉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebuilt stone for stone and restored to all of its original glory.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.86,1:47:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是给我的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.99,1:47:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我几乎忘了 我太沉醉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I almost forgot. I got so flustered…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.41,1:47:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想过来这念书吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, child, have you ever thought of studying here?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.29,1:47:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would that be possible?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.87,1:47:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我们看看你合不合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come along. Let's see if you have the aptitude.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.08,1:47:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}To a long association.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.04,1:47:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,过程如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the process?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.21,1:47:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very simple.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.34,1:48:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,18%的可卡因 与普通汽油混合\N{\fnArial\fs30}An 18% mixture of cocaine and ordinary gasoline.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.64,1:48:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep quiet.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:27.91,1:48:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经把你第一批货 装好在四辆油罐车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We already have your first shipment being loaded into the four tanker trucks.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.25,1:48:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎光临\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.09,1:48:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please join me.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.26,1:48:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.35,1:48:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我远离尘土的神圣净宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my humble sanctuary away from the cares of the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.14,1:48:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个人的沉思教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your own private meditation chamber.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.56,1:48:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,用庙里圣石所建\N{\fnArial\fs30}Built from the sacred rocks of the original temple.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.44,1:49:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,修建了隔音 所以没有东西打扰我沉思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did have it soundproofed, so nothing will disturb our meditation.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.16,1:49:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你带来另一个惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought you another surprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.04,1:49:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢惊喜 在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love surprises. Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.38,1:49:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的没必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, this really isn't necessary.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.14,1:49:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,钥匙给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the keys.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.90,1:49:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bless your heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.45,1:49:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,每月会由油轮运送\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your monthly delivery will be by ocean-going tanker.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.78,1:49:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会请化学技术主任 过去协助你还原过程\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll send our chief chemist along to supervise the reconversion process.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.21,1:49:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,把汽油留着当红利\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll keep the gas as a bonus.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.63,1:50:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一海关有问题 没有证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if there's a problem with customs, no evidence.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:14.98,1:50:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.61,1:50:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识他！他是告密者！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know him. He's an informer.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.53,1:50:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你令我失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}You disappoint me.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.49,1:50:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你替谁工作？告诉我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you working for, huh? Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.38,1:50:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't wanna talk?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:55.56,1:50:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能弄走油罐车 但控制不了火势！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can get the trucks out, but I don't think I can control the fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.73,1:51:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管火了 车开走 开走油罐车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget the fire. Get some cars.We're gonna take the tankers with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.53,1:51:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 这里花了三千二百万盖成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. This setup cost us $32 million.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.57,1:51:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要想办法救\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to try and save it.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.03,1:51:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't give a shit about the setup.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.87,1:51:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮箱里有五亿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got $500 million in the case and.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.08,1:51:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十顿可卡因\N{\fnArial\fs30}20 tons of Colombian pure in the tankers.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.45,1:51:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮海先生！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now go help Heller.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.66,1:51:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但跟东方人谈好生意 也收了他们的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we have a deal with the Orientals. We've got their money.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.83,1:51:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,去帮海先生！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said go help Heller.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.76,1:51:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,要好过还是难过？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, do you wanna make this hard or easy?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.89,1:51:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他放到输送带上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put him in the conveyor.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.45,1:51:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,当到你脚踝时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you're up to your ankles,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.91,1:51:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就会招了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna beg to tell me everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.95,1:51:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,到膝盖时 你会感激我杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you're up to your knees, you'll kiss my ass to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.79,1:52:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是你的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the least of your problems, Sanchez.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.67,1:52:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你不相信克罗斯 你能相信谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you couldn't trust Krest, who can you trust?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.26,1:52:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁拿走你五亿员？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's got your $500 million?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:12.43,1:52:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜鲁门？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truman-Lodge?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.35,1:52:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞弹呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the Stingers?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.27,1:52:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,对飞弹你知道多少？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know about Stingers?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.99,1:52:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得走了 这里随时会爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta go, patron. This place'll blow up any second.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.16,1:52:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,海先生呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Heller?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:32.20,1:52:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.32,1:52:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你最后一次 见海先生和飞弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the last you'll see of Heller and your Stingers.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:41.33,1:52:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的忠告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for the advice.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.51,1:52:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,开我的车到顶层见 跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have my car meet me up at the top. Braun, come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.64,1:53:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.31,1:53:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你正好说了我要说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took the words right out of my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:52.95,1:53:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑契斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sanchez!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:02.91,1:54:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:04.83,1:54:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,关掉机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Switch the bloody machine off.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.68,1:54:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要确定这些东西会很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. I was making sure these were secure.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.48,1:54:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意 拿上我的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a good idea. Take them up to my car.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:28.61,1:54:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.90,1:55:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 是海先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. It's Heller.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:16.45,1:55:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来他走到死胡同了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Looks like he came to a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.45,1:55:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:34.46,1:55:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点 跟上我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on! Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.56,1:55:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You. Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:05.20,1:56:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:22.01,1:56:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,意外吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:25.39,1:56:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,保佑你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bless your heart!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.96,1:58:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩雷兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perez.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:17.00,1:58:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond has escaped.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.54,1:58:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,在魔鬼关口等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet me at Paso del Diablo.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:10.64,1:59:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 只是钱而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. It's only money.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:40.54,1:59:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, que pase.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:35.41,2:01:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:39.66,2:01:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:53.38,2:01:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,太聪明了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:56.18,2:01:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,法兰斯 漂亮！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done, Franz.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:58.06,2:02:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,又有八千万美金可以抵税\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another $80 million write-off.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:02.06,2:02:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是缩短固定支出的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess it's time to start cutting overhead.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:09.23,2:04:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dame el Stinger!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:12.83,2:05:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}James!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:10.45,2:07:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本来可以拥有一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have had everything.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:11.99,2:07:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想知道原因吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you want to know why?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:14.01,2:08:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你等什么？上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you waiting for? Get in.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:17.77,2:08:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:31.91,2:08:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我下周就出院了 可以去钓鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be up to see you next week. We'll do some fishing.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:33.95,2:08:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到时候也出院了 M打来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. I'll be out by then. M called.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:36.54,2:08:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想找你 他有任务给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tried to reach you. I think he may have a job for you.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:40.12,2:08:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲力克 我得走了 我的主人刚到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Felix, I have to go. My hostess has just arrived.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:43.34,2:08:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care, James.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:44.42,2:08:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, too. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:49.01,2:08:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你不喜欢那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you hated that thing.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:50.34,2:08:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道？蜥蜴是女孩的好友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you know, iguanas are a girl's best friend.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:01.31,2:09:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, here's to you, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:03.56,2:09:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:06.48,2:09:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for everything, James.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:12.16,2:09:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:26.13,2:09:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以跟我留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could stay here with me.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:29.67,2:09:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:43.06,2:09:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和总统阁下 会是理想的一对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you and el Presidente will make a perfect couple.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:19.18,2:10:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何不等别人要求你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you wait until you're asked?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:22.48,2:10:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何不要求我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, why don't you ask me?
